scn 1
# The runner's smoke case: 48 synthetic movers (footprint 2) cross an open
# map to one click. One selection under 64 commands, so it lands in one tick
# and Legion makes one group of it. Used by the legion_scenario_smoke and
# observer_neutral ctests.
name smoke-open
ticks 1200
seed 7
map flat 128 96
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.8
group A 0 m 48 rect 10 30 34 48
gate mid 64 20 64 76
line far 96 0 96 96
region goal 92 32 116 64
at 1 move A 104 48
